  "word_count": 592,
  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n# Contact Dr. Nahlah in Tysons Corner (McLean) & Alexandria, VA\n\n\n\n## Get in Touch\n\n\nBook Now\n\n\n##### Tyson’s Corner\n\n\nDr. Nahlah Implants and Prosthodontics Specialists\n\n7901 Jones Branch Drive Suit 220 McLean, VA 22102\n\n✆ New Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\n✆ Current Patients: (703) 493-1358\n\n\n##### Alexandria\n\n\n2855 Duke St, Alexandria, VA 22314\n\n✆ New Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\n✆ Current Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n##### General Inquires\n\n\nName(Required)\n\nFirst\n\nLast\n\nEmail(Required)\n\nPhone(Required)\n\nUntitled(Required)\n\nPlease, click here and select reason for consultationDental ImplantsVeneersCrownBridgeSmile Makeover\n\n\n## Office Hours\n\n\n🕐 Office Hours:\n\nMonday – Thursday | 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM\n\nFriday | 8:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\nSaturday & Sunday | Closed\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
